{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：14:00 2026-10-06 HKT</p>\n\n<p>Marvel電影《尚氣與十環幫傳奇》在亞洲地區打開知名度的加拿大籍華裔男星劉思慕（Simu Liu），去年向拍拖逾3年的台裔才女Allison Hsu求婚成功，近日傳出劉思慕與Allison Hsu已於剛過去的周末在法國低調舉行婚禮，步入人生新階段，不過劉思慕及其團隊尚未證實結婚喜訊。</p>\n<h2>劉思慕公開戀情頻放閃</h2>\n<p>據美媒《TMZ》引述消息人士指出，劉思慕與Allison Hsu已於上周末舉行結婚儀式。二人的戀情始於2022年，同年12月結伴出席電影《殺神夜》（Violent Night）首映禮，首度公開情侶關係，劉思慕之後頻頻放閃。</p>\n<img alt=\"劉思慕與Allison Hsu已一齊4年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a813dedfc14db05dbf3646a033278ad2/2025-05/allison_1710201409_3321732640221735472_6450493.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有美媒報道，劉思慕與Allison Hsu已於日前低調舉行婚禮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/623c55b1df4a4ec4a0992ae4cd0076ae/2025-05/allison_1710201409_3321732640079127884_6450493.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Allison Hsu曾分享疑似婚照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/439455855669b5458f5e092c6b4b8e90/2025-05/allison_1710201409_3321732640204951769_6450493.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有指劉思慕與Allison Hsu的婚禮在法國舉行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fe9658cb25865c5e885b94b93772cfec/2026-10/lau_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉思慕已成為人夫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9bb7becd12f249aed1d1085e22e4e0f7/2026-10/lau_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉思慕未有開腔回應已婚消息。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/55e0de110fa49e4a727b24c9295d7cbc/2026-10/lau_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉思去年宣布求婚成功。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0f636455e94bbd4af158691b2afb3a7c/2025-05/simuliu_1746985808_3630302538787708811_203149979.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉思慕與Allison Hsu甜蜜咀嘴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/59f04c1243eb84017782603da04c1f2e/2026-10/lau_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉思慕與Allison Hsu晒幸福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/915f46bf207b22bbc990ce8eadc27ba7/2026-10/lau_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Allison Hsu輕撫劉思慕臉頰，一臉甜蜜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bdf26fadb4c9256a5a7294c1dc09cf22/2026-10/lau_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Allison Hsu靠在劉思慕胸膛，露出幸福表情。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/156bd10dd4e1236fa9d43189d10a0b16/2026-10/lau_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉思慕向台裔才女Allison Hsu求婚成功。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a0f5b12d6ed3db043c4c95601ca8d785/2025-05/allison_1746985368_3630298851433405159_6450493.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"台裔才女Allison Hsu大晒劉思慕的求婚戒指。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f8fd021bb05d9d3e5f55680e3a8f0d36/2025-05/allison_1746985368_3630298851592776273_6450493.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉思慕向台裔才女Allison Hsu求婚的鑽戒好大粒鑽石。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/073f7a4aec5aff73a39b48cd620dbc21/2025-05/allison_1746985368_3630298851357921736_6450493.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉思慕用巨型「鴿子蛋」鑽戒求婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4a733fc62f8cc83435adecf847e6eb5f/2025-05/allison_1746985368_3630298851357949798_6450493.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉思慕在法國求婚好浪漫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/abae94036cd6e3b107d9a8a3bbea281d/2025-05/allison_1746985368_3630298851357894006_6450493.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉思慕與Allison Hsu放閃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/64498b601fa17fe668b349f189012e13/2025-05/allison_1746985368_3630298851366363152_6450493.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉思慕有指已成為人夫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/519dc18c53005cc3316ae3c65f36b371/2026-10/Allison_23_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉思慕早前去法國。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3697ba01301fe6df6e9ad921c3e080ba/2026-10/Allison_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉思慕多度跟Allison Hsu遊法國。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/98813f6a7f2074a40311ca81d57f4b76/2026-10/Allison_22_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉思慕與Allison Hsu好恩愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1f898d658d4bd2fd83e9456f372152d3/2025-05/allison_1735535133_3534247317907001934_6450493.jpg\"/>\n<p>劉思慕去年5月趁與Allison在法國巴黎度假，精心策劃浪漫求婚，並邀請美國樂壇天后Taylor Swift親自拍片，向身為Taylor Swift超級粉絲Allison送上祝賀，給予Allison極大的驚喜。早前Allison與一眾閨密好友到墨西哥舉行告別單身派對，曾暗示即將成為人妻。</p>\n<h2>劉思慕太太才貌兼備</h2>\n<p>劉思慕的新婚妻Allison背景顯赫，於2017年加入美國一間知名的唱片公司工作，從實習生做起，目前擔任唱片公司Interscope的數碼市場營運總監。Allison於2022年榮登國際財經雜誌《福布斯》（Forbes）的「音樂界30歲以下傑出人士」榜單，可謂才貌兼備。</p>\n<img alt=\"劉思慕憑《尚氣》在亞洲影壇打開知名度。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/178d9fb21b5445742cb71df0b79fce13/2025-05/A4_9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉思慕與陳法拉曾在《尚氣》中合作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c7eb1a6fcd5ac3b5e0e6df6f4eca371c/2025-05/A3_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉思慕憑《尚氣》而走紅，戲中與陳法拉飾演母子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f707429d4ad12cbe9729b4ce505cfbd6/2025-05/A2_10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉思慕太太Allison Hsu是唱片公司Interscope的數碼市場營運總監。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f468479851321e5a1fda6132f309bf96/2026-10/Allison_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Allison Hsu早前疑似籌備婚禮，頻頻更新IG。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b1aaad006973cddc7ebe86e50e4a7225/2026-10/Allison_19_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Allison Hsu曾在IG留言：「30 in Paris💘💘💘 Can't believe the best is somehow still yet to come, Grateful every day」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d322ed0de7f778acf9ea9a359cd6fea7/2026-10/Allison_20_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Allison Hsu今年8月慶祝生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d1f5d295cdb10fb1a2750e60e07b2c82/2026-10/Allison_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Allison Hsu慶祝生日，但打扮似結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dec0f578dddf3437546ddfd11160df4f/2026-10/Allison_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Allison Hsu穿上白色露背長裙。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5ecb0844a46cd40c0c1577d8a86aaaf1/2026-10/Allison_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Allison Hsu早前與好友拉隊舉行婚前派對。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/edcc58e6756099c1434fc88df57ba0da/2026-10/Allison_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Allison Hsu疑在告別單身派對順道影婚照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c85fae87d0b8ddb7e6a3fb229a2868a2/2026-10/Allison_27_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Allison Hsu在IG分享不少照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/df247e2606f15c2f9a27ec919598accf/2026-10/miss_to_mrs_with_all_my_bitches.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"疑是Allison Hsu的婚紗照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/68cc2e0c4574fc455e1e0d0695624d24/2026-10/Allison_26_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"背面相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0f778d1df05305da336b27d8a7050dd0/2026-10/Allison_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Allison Hsu在IG公開照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9da932296c0af1884e67a51f63a84992/2026-10/Allison_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Allison Hsu換上多條吊帶裙。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/01b85fe235ab2966ee89c1c87f897942/2026-10/Allison_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Allison Hsu似乎喜愛備簡撲的造型。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1bc19a3fa6c4eba50c9abb0819ea6ae5/2026-10/Allison_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Allison Hsu與閨密倒數成為人妻的時光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ce1d859e520d526b21a6575f920b28f2/2026-10/Allison_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Allison Hsu打卡地點見到在墨西哥。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/35f7230663c109a5fb1c8217571eecb5/2026-10/Allison_25_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Allison Hsu與一班好姊妹舉行告別單身派對。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/05046101590d73974abeb35728f27a4a/2026-10/Allison_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Allison Hsu的告別單身派對好熱鬧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/884d0f2fedbf8f45c6215b1e867aa59b/2026-10/Allison_14_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T06:19:06.207237+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":583,"images":42,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}